# .dockerignore patterns match relative to the build context root, but Docker
# does NOT apply them recursively into subdirectories unless prefixed with **.
**/build/
**/.gradle/
**/out/
**/*.iml
.idea/

# Local dev DB / uploads — never belong in the image.
**/data/
**/uploads/

# Local-only override file (gitignored, sometimes contains a real OpenAI key
# during local development) — must never reach the build context.
**/application-local.yml
**/application-local.yml.example

.DS_Store
